<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>{{>head}}<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/index.css" media="screen"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://yookassa.ru/integration/simplepay/css/yookassa_construct_form.css"></head>
<body class="home-page">
<header class="site-header payment-header"><div class="site-header__inner">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Ирина Аравина<span>Психолог · коуч</span></a>
    <a class="payment-header__back" href="/prices">← Вернуться к услугам и стоимости</a>
</div></header>
<main class="inner-page payment-page">
    <section class="inner-hero payment-intro"><div class="section__inner"><p class="eyebrow">Оплата выбранной услуги</p><h1>Проверьте детали и заполните данные</h1><p>Убедитесь, что выбрали нужную консультацию, затем укажите контактные данные для оплаты.</p></div></section>
    <section class="payment-area"><div class="section__inner payment-area__inner">
        <aside class="payment-summary"><p class="eyebrow">Ваш выбор</p><h2>{{product.name}}</h2><p>Индивидуальная консультация</p><strong>{{product.prettyAmount}}</strong></aside>
        <div class="payment-form-wrap">
            <form class="yoomoney-payment-form" action="https://yookassa.ru/integration/simplepay/payment" method="post" accept-charset="utf-8">
                <div class="ym-products"><div class="ym-block-title ym-products-title">Услуга</div><div class="ym-product"><div class="ym-product-line"><span class="ym-product-description"><span class="ym-product-count">1×</span>{{product.name}}</span><span class="ym-product-price" data-price="{{product.doubleAmount}}" data-id="928">{{product.prettyAmount}}</span></div>
                    <input disabled type="hidden" name="text" value="{{product.name}}"><input disabled type="hidden" name="price" value="{{product.doubleAmount}}"><input disabled type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1"><input disabled type="hidden" name="paymentSubjectType" value="service"><input disabled type="hidden" name="paymentMethodType" value="full_prepayment"><input disabled type="hidden" name="tax" value="1"></div></div>
                <input value="" type="hidden" name="ym_merchant_receipt">
                <div class="ym-customer-info"><div class="ym-block-title">О покупателе</div><input name="cps_email" class="ym-input" placeholder="Email" type="text" value=""><input name="cps_phone" class="ym-input" placeholder="Телефон" type="text" value=""><input name="custName" class="ym-input" placeholder="ФИО" type="text" value=""><textarea class="ym-textarea" name="orderDetails" placeholder="Комментарий"></textarea></div>
                <div class="ym-hidden-inputs"></div><input name="customerNumber" type="hidden" value="{{product.name}}">
                <div class="ym-payment-btn-block ym-before-line ym-align-space-between"><div class="ym-input-icon-rub ym-display-none"><input name="sum" placeholder="0.00" class="ym-input ym-sum-input ym-required-input" type="number" step="any" value="{{product.doubleAmount}}"></div><button data-text="Оплатить" class="ym-btn-pay ym-result-price"><span class="ym-text-crop">Оплатить</span> <span class="ym-price-output">{{product.prettyAmount}}</span></button><span class="payment-provider">Оплата через ЮKassa</span></div>
                <input name="shopId" type="hidden" value="204131">
            </form>
        </div>
    </div></section>
    <p class="payment-help">Вопросы по оплате? <a href="https://t.me/monako_irina" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Напишите в Telegram</a>.</p>
</main>
<footer class="payment-footer"><a href="/">Ирина Аравина</a><span>© Ирина Аравина</span></footer>
<script src="https://yookassa.ru/integration/simplepay/js/yookassa_construct_form.js"></script>
</body></html>
